{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_6_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_6","textTraditional":"一、六年，春，鄭人來輸平。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_6_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_6","textTraditional":"輸者，墮也。平之為言以道成也。來輸平者，不果成也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_6_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_6","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，辛酉，公會齊侯，盟於艾。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_6_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_6","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_6_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_6","textTraditional":"四、冬，宋人取長葛。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_6_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_6","textTraditional":"外取邑不志，此其志何也？久之也。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}